.Dd September 19, 2026
.Dt BUSYBOX-MODUTILS 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm busybox-modutils ,
.Nm depmod ,
.Nm insmod ,
.Nm lsmod ,
.Nm modinfo ,
.Nm modprobe ,
.Nm rmmod
.Nd BusyBox module tools
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm depmod
.Op Fl n
.Nm insmod
.Ar FILE
.Op Ar SYMBOL=VALUE
.Ar ...
.Nm lsmod
.Nm modinfo
.Op Fl adlpn0
.Op Fl F Ar keyword
.Ar MODULE
.Nm modprobe
.Op Fl rq
.Ar MODULE
.Op Ar SYMBOL=VALUE
.Ar ...
.Nm rmmod
.Ar MODULE ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These are the modutils applets of BusyBox 1.36.1 as built for Rach2.
Rach2 has no loadable kernel modules; these applets have no Rach2 modules
to operate on.
They report errors for unavailable module files or operations.
.Bl -tag -width modprobe
.It Nm depmod
Generate the module dependency file
.Pa modules.dep.bb .
.It Nm insmod
Load a kernel module.
.It Nm lsmod
List loaded kernel modules.
.It Nm modinfo
Display information about a kernel module.
.It Nm modprobe
Load a kernel module, or remove it with
.Fl r .
.It Nm rmmod
Unload kernel modules.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Ss depmod
.Bl -tag -width "-n"
.It Fl n
Print the dependency file to standard output without writing it.
.El
.Ss modinfo
.Bl -tag -width "-F description"
.It Fl a
Equivalent to
.Fl F Cm author .
.It Fl d
Equivalent to
.Fl F Cm description .
.It Fl l
Equivalent to
.Fl F Cm license .
.It Fl p
Equivalent to
.Fl F Cm parm .
.El
.Ss modprobe
.Bl -tag -width "-r"
.It Fl r
Remove the module.
.It Fl q
Suppress the diagnostic of a failed module removal; other errors are
reported.
.El
.Sh HISTORY
The applet descriptions are adapted from BusyBox 1.36.1 documentation,
licensed under GPL-2.0.
